From 6b5a9c1aa15b39688ff07fb78ce5c182078ef20c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:44:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: type header validation, block import and reorg
 diagnostics

Convert 24 application producers using original categories and levels, raw block/parent/transaction hashes, numeric heights/file offsets and copied reasons. Preserve duplicate invalid-parent sites, all validation outcomes, reorg accounting, import progression and warning text. No consensus or P2P behavior changes.

Scripted diff commands:
/private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --root . --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/validation-header-reorg-diagnostics.json --report /private/tmp/logging-core-validation-report.json --apply
git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style "{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}" HEAD -- src/validation.cpp src/kernel/disconnected_transactions.cpp src/init.cpp
python3 test/lint/lint-log-events.py src/validation.cpp src/kernel/disconnected_transactions.cpp src/init.cpp
git diff --check

Source-only: NOT_COMPILED / NOT_RUN. Reuse validation/reorg/import controls after the benchmark resource window; rare failures not forced. Long snapshot/abort facades and command privacy remain explicitly deferred.
